# Trial by Fire (outlands 12), the battlefield's arms without the whisper. The battlefield's own requirements stay in its
# Lua file (BattlefieldQuest: the quest's status accepted or more, and the fork; status and key item reads): available
# with the fork: no menu (MSG 7258); accepted without the fork: no menu. Accepted with the fork: 32000, arena 1 entered
# (the fork taken), Ifrit_Prime_TBF killed: won (battlefieldWin 544), 32001 opens in the kill step; the local var set to
# 545 (Trial-Size Trial by Fire's id) by a GM with 32001 open (the battlefieldWin operand alone): finished: no whisper,
# no title.
lists CloisterOfFlames/FP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfFlames/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=CloisterOfFlames pos=-720.631,-1.4,-597.955 job=WAR lvl=75
keyitem TuningForkOfFire
login
trigger FP_Entrance                     # available, the fork: no menu
quest Outlands.TrialByFire accepted     # a GM
delkeyitem TuningForkOfFire             # a GM
trigger FP_Entrance                     # accepted, no fork: no menu
keyitem TuningForkOfFire                # a GM
trigger FP_Entrance                     # accepted, the fork: 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # arena 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
kill IFRIT_PRIME_ASA-21                 # won: battlefieldWin 544; 32001 opens
localvar battlefieldWin 545             # a GM, 32001 open
finish                                  # battlefieldWin 545: nothing
